config BR2_PACKAGE_APPLIANCE_DIAG
	bool "appliance-diag"
	help
	  Original Phase 3 diagnostic utility.  It reports the kernel release,
	  the appliance identity marker installed by the root filesystem overlay,
	  and the device tree model string exposed by the kernel.

	  Used by P3-M06 to exercise Buildroot's package build-stamp semantics.
